{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/learn/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/page,_N_T_/learn/tudor-jones-risk-first-interviews"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--2DJ2zhzL_dHSrK5QsdDKA--><html lang=\"zh-TW\" data-density=\"comfortable\" data-font-size=\"standard\" class=\"__variable_07e1b6 __variable_cc7473 h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/3d26d2f3aa81a833-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/604a121a6fa1a135-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/6e1768769e6f59a2-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ab2e3a11646b0499-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/75c047ba52e43fcc.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/aa90c9a426448e43.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/e55779c04dd245e2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/8c57d5c3b938342e.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/3eaf36e367672966.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-100b9d70ed4e49c1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1255-ab54a41c275880be.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-acf4587a940f1946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/learn/%5Bslug%5D/page-f7b99344f7e2ee16.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>都鐸瓊斯怎麼看風險？金融怪傑裡反覆出現的3件事｜股市大佬 TradeBoss</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"保羅·都鐸·瓊斯在公開訪談裡給人的印象，常被剪成「抓大行情的人」。同一批訪談更穩定的句子，其實圍繞防守：先想會輸多少、錯了要快、以及不要讓單一看法決定你還能不能交易。這三件和李佛摩、海龜留下的結構很像，只是語氣不同。神準不能學，防守可以檢查。\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-theme');if(t!=='light'&&t!=='dark')t='dark';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);document.documentElement.style.colorScheme=(t==='light'?'light':'dark');}catch(e){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','dark');}})();(function(){try{if(localStorage.getItem('obsidian-comfort-read')==='1')document.documentElement.classList.add('comfort-read');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var s=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-updown');if(s==='us')document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-updown','us');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var prefs=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('bs-preferences-v1')||'{}');var root=document.documentElement;prefs=prefs&&typeof prefs==='object'?prefs:{};root.setAttribute('data-font-size',['standard','large','xlarge','huge'].indexOf(prefs.fontSize)>=0?prefs.fontSize:'standard');root.setAttribute('data-density',prefs.density==='compact'?'compact':'comfortable');}catch(e){}})();</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground selection:bg-cyan/30 review-mode pb-40 lg:pb-16\" data-review-theme=\"dark\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link fixed left-3 top-3 z-[80] -translate-y-24 rounded-xl bg-accent px-4 py-2 font-black text-bg shadow-lg transition focus:translate-y-0\">跳到主要內容</a><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_wrap__LIQ8G\"><article class=\"LearnArticle_article__2nBbk\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_meta__etj_G\"><a class=\"LearnArticle_cat__GQMlg\" href=\"/learn?c=stories\">人物與市場史</a><span class=\"LearnArticle_read__QEj6a\">閱讀約 3 分鐘</span></p><h1 class=\"LearnArticle_title__0_la8\">都鐸瓊斯怎麼看風險？金融怪傑裡反覆出現的3件事</h1><details class=\"LearnArticle_toc__LcSAa\"><summary class=\"LearnArticle_tocSummary__YBddG\">本文目錄</summary><ol class=\"LearnArticle_tocList__Rq_Lz\"><li><a href=\"#sec-1\">一、先把剪輯放下</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-2\">二、三件被反覆轉述的事</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-3\">三、為什麼「快」比「準」常被他強調</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-4\">四、不要把人物讀成風格標籤</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-5\">五、最小動作</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-6\">常見問題 FAQ</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-7\">總結</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-8\">延伸閱讀</a></li></ol></details><div class=\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\">保羅·都鐸·瓊斯在公開訪談裡給人的印象，常被剪成「抓大行情的人」。同一批訪談更穩定的句子，其實圍繞防守：先想會輸多少、錯了要快、以及不要讓單一看法決定你還能不能交易。這三件和李佛摩、海龜留下的結構很像，只是語氣不同。神準不能學，防守可以檢查。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\"><b class=\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\">本文重點</b><ul class=\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\"><li>公開訪談裡，他先講防守再講機會</li><li>錯了要快，不是因為膽小，是因為本金是門票</li><li>單一看法太大，等於把職業生涯押在一次心情</li></ul></div><section id=\"sec-1\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">一、先把剪輯放下</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">後來的傳播喜歡留「看對大波段」的畫面。訪談原文比較常停在：若這筆錯了，我還在不在。對讀者，剪輯會害你去學方向；原文比較像在教你先設天花板。天花板不是目標，是你輸得起的上限。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>傳播愛方向</li><li>訪談愛防守</li><li>你要學的是上限</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-2\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">二、三件被反覆轉述的事</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">第一，進場前先算最壞。第二，最壞碰到就走，不在虧損裡找新理由。第三，部位小到連續錯幾次仍能按同一套規則做。這三件在海龜與風險優先那兩篇也出現過，說明不是某一個人的個性，是能留下來的人共同的順序。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\"><table class=\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\"><thead><tr><th>訪談裡的順序</th><th>業餘常見順序</th><th>差在哪</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>先問會輸多少</td><td>先問會賺多少</td><td>門票還在不在</td></tr><tr><td>錯了先走</td><td>錯了再研究</td><td>研究應在場外</td></tr><tr><td>連續錯仍做得下去</td><td>錯兩次就改方法</td><td>樣本被心情打斷</td></tr><tr><td>大行情是結果</td><td>大行情是目標</td><td>目標會逼你加碼</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"sec-3\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">三、為什麼「快」比「準」常被他強調</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">公開表述裡，認錯的速度被當成技術。慢的代價不是面子，是下一筆沒有足夠本金。準當然好，但準無法事先保證；快可以寫成規則。規則寫得動的，才是你能練的。</p><ol class=\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\"><li>把最壞寫成數字</li><li>碰到就走</li><li>走了再檢討準不準</li></ol><figure class=\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\">!去學抓轉折!把大行情當目標!忽略上限</div><figcaption class=\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\">剪輯會害你</figcaption></figure></section><section id=\"sec-4\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">四、不要把人物讀成風格標籤</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">有人把他標成短線、有人標成宏觀。標籤會讓你去模仿外表。訪談能用的是決策順序。順序可以放進當沖，也可以放進波段，重點是上限與認錯，不是週期名稱。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>週期是容器</li><li>上限是內容</li><li>先學內容</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-5\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">五、最小動作</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">下一筆下單前多一行：最壞是多少、碰到誰有權叫我走。寫不出來，就還在看剪輯，不在用訪談。</p></section><section id=\"sec-6\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">常見問題 FAQ</h2><div class=\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\"><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>他是不是特別能抓轉折？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">傳播這樣講。訪談裡更穩定的是防守。轉折不能當教材的主詞。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>快認錯會不會常常被洗？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">會。所以部位要小到被洗了還能繼續。大部位配快認錯，人會做不到。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>和李佛摩差在哪？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">公開材料都強調認賠。李佛摩的故事還有歸零；這篇只取訪談裡的防守順序。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>宏觀交易散戶能學嗎？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">學順序，不學他的商品與規模。</p></details></div></section><section id=\"sec-7\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">總結</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">都鐸瓊斯公開訪談裡反覆出現的是防守：先算最壞、錯了快走、部位小到能連錯。剪輯愛方向，教材愛上限。</p></section><section id=\"sec-8\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">延伸閱讀</h2><ul class=\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\"><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/why-professional-traders-put-risk-first\">為什麼風險優先</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/market-wizards-what-interviews-really-left\">金融怪傑訪談留下什麼</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/jesse-livermore-lessons-not-the-legend\">李佛摩的教訓</a></li></ul></section><div class=\"LearnArticle_related__9qV55\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_relatedTitle__RXfrl\">相關文章</p><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/why-professional-traders-put-risk-first\">為什麼風險優先</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/market-wizards-what-interviews-really-left\">金融怪傑訪談留下什麼</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/jesse-livermore-lessons-not-the-legend\">李佛摩的教訓</a></div></div></article></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[81259,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[89379,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[98924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[10021,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510